# SCREEN_FLOW.png
Web + App screens flow diagram
This diagram illustrates the flow of the system for both web portal (Admin/Teacher) and mobile app (Student/Teacher):

Web Portal:
- Login / Authentication
- Dashboard (Admin: manage schools/users/exams; Teacher: create exams, select items, view results)
- Exam Management (Create/Edit/Delete, assign items)
- Results & Reports
- Settings

Mobile App:
- Login / Authentication
- Dashboard (Available exams, countdown timers)
- Exam Taking (MCQ/TF/Matching)
- Results Viewing (Auto-graded)
